--TEST--
a class written as a field's type inside a shape type opens the class's declaration, though the innermost node is the shape, `rule:types/shape-type`, `rule:ide/the-index-answers-the-cursor`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Customer
{
    public string $name = "";
}

class Shop
{
    public static function place({owner: Cus<|>tomer, note?: string} $order): void {}
}

Shop::place({owner: new Customer(), note: "gift"});
--REQUEST--
definition
--EXPECT--
